
Data Quality Checks – Gold Layer


Purpose:
    This script validates the integrity, consistency, and accuracy of the
    Gold layer in the data warehouse.

    It ensures:
    - Uniqueness of keys in dimension tables
    - Referential integrity between fact and dimension tables
    - Correct relationships within the analytical data model

Usage:
    Review any records returned by these checks and resolve data issues
    before using the data for reporting or analytics.

-- ====================================================================
-- Validation: gold_customers
-- ====================================================================
-- Check for duplicate customer keys
-- Expected result: No rows returned

SELECT 
    customer_key,
    COUNT(*) AS duplicate_count
FROM gold_customers
GROUP BY customer_key
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1;

-- ====================================================================
-- Validation: gold_product_dimension
-- ====================================================================
-- Check for duplicate product keys
-- Expected result: No rows returned

SELECT 
    product_key,
    COUNT(*) AS duplicate_count
FROM gold_product_dimension
GROUP BY product_key_num
HAVING COUNT(*) > 1;

-- ====================================================================
-- Validation: gold_product_sales
-- ====================================================================
-- Check referential integrity between fact and dimension tables
-- Expected result: No rows returned

SELECT *
FROM gold_product_sales f
LEFT JOIN gold_customers c
    ON f.customer_key = c.customer_key
LEFT JOIN gold_product_sales p
    ON f.product_key_num = p.product_key
WHERE c.customer_key IS NULL
   OR p.product_key IS NULL;
